--TEST--
an import names a type, and a `Core` type is declared in its generated stub, so a cursor in `use Core\Http\Method;` opens that stub on the enum's line, `rule:ide/the-stub-tree-is-where-core-is-declared`
--FILE--
<?nvs
use Core\Http\Met<|>hod;

var $verb = Method::Get;
echo $verb;
--REQUEST--
definition
--EXPECT--
